<CAPABILITIES>
To take action in any of the applications listed in AVAILABLE_RESOURCES,
use the `browser` tool to open its URL and interact with the page (click,
type, scroll, etc.). The applications are real web apps you can drive
through the browser — do not assume you cannot use them, and do not try
to call their APIs from a shell unless you have explicit endpoint docs.

When you need to communicate with the user, send a message directly.
When you are done, use the finish tool.
</CAPABILITIES>

